                    "text": "Love stinghe write Tina Turners song \nSilentwings.  And I\u2019ve always thought of him as a brilliant writer and producer for the way, the film with the Eagles told the story of Silentwings it\u2019s beautiful. I never get tired of it and Tina can sing thing. I love you. I think you are the bomb. Amen in Jesus name. I pray I wish you love, peace and happiness. You\u2019re a wonderful, wonderful artist and performer. Thank you for this very special time and song. I have always held close to my heart as I felt, I lived that dream though it was hurtful he taught me to be brave, honest and real the ending was sad but they both went their separate ways and became better amen. Thank you Tina. You delivered it well rest in peace. We\u2019re listening all the time we miss you and we\u2019ll see you soon so then dance with the angels sing with them too they love you and so do we amen. In Jesus name I pray.\u2764",
